<title>BELGIUM: EU clears CGE control of South Eastern - EU source.</title>
<headline>EU clears CGE control of South Eastern - EU source.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission on Tuesday cleared the acquisition of Britain's South Eastern Train Company Ltd by Companie Generale d'Enterprises Automobiles, the transport subsidiary of France's CGE, a European Union source said.</p>
<p>There were no details available. A formal statement was expected later on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
